@startuml studio_block_flow

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam ActivityBorderThickness 1
skinparam ActivityFontColor #333333
skinparam ActivityFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #6366F1
skinparam ArrowFontColor #777777
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam TitleFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ActivityStartColor #6366F1
skinparam ActivityEndColor #6366F1
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam Padding 2
skinparam roundCorner 10

title K9X Studio — Spec Import, Top to Bottom

start

:**Browser**\nIntake panel → upload spec doc\n(one of several intake paths);

:**FastAPI**\nroute_event("spec_import");

:**K9EventRouter**\ndispatch to orchestrator;

:**SpecImportOrchestrator**\nload & run squad;

:**SpecImportSquad**\nGovernance → SpecParser (spawns\nsub-agents) → LLM Grouping →\nScoring → Canvas Building;

:**Browser**\nCanvas auto-populates;

stop

@enduml
